    "description": "Compared protect-secrets specification and catalog contract with main; authored scenarios and dependency ownership are unchanged. The change is limited to contributor verification: the two exact-source Python suite jobs run concurrently and both gate the runtime, isolated performance and package job; local make ci retains every check.",
