    "tests": "The fixture streams a split secret, checks persisted native request redaction, restores the original secret option for the owning reply, resumes the retained native thread on a new service, and asserts retained transcript contains redaction without plaintext. This assertion stays selected by the complete suite inventory. Inspection is distinct from final execution; complete reconciliation and separate local CI remain required, and no real-host acceptance is claimed."
